Scenario "completion_at_bottom_margin"
Command "CARGO_BIN_EXE_maqi"
Env PATH "/nonexistent"
Terminal rows 4 cols 48
Cursor row 4 col 1

Step "start at the bottom"
WaitFrontendLineStartsWith "maqi>" timeout 5000ms
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |················································|
  r01 |················································|
  r02 |················································|
  r03 |maqi>···········································|

Step "show completion without an extra wrapped blank row"
Input "kubectl config get-"
Input tab
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl·config·get-·······················|
  r01 |>·get-clusters··Display·clusters·defined·in·the…|
  r02 |··get-contexts··Describe·one·or·many·contexts···|
  r03 |··get-users·····Display·users·defined·in·the·ku…|

Step "dismiss the menu"
Input escape
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl·config·get-·······················|
  r01 |················································|
  r02 |················································|
  r03 |················································|

Step "continue at the native cursor"
Input "X"
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·kubectl·config·get-X······················|
  r01 |················································|
  r02 |················································|
  r03 |················································|
